# Production Compose uses service-scoped files so the PostgreSQL bootstrap
# credential is never present in web or worker containers. Copy the matching
# files below without the .example suffix and provide real values via the
# platform secret manager. Do not combine their credentials into one file.
#
#   .env.production.database  PostgreSQL container initialization only
#   .env.production.bootstrap Foundation role/database bootstrap only
#   .env.production.migrate   Django migration identity only
#   .env.production.web       restricted web runtime identity only
#   .env.production.worker    restricted outbox worker identity only
#
# See deploy/compose.production.yml for the exact service mapping.
